WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:03.937
.

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:06.439 line:78%
NOW, WE ARE FIGHTING FOR

00:00:04.037 --> 00:00:09.009 line:78%
SURVIVAL.

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:09.275 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Dana: IT HAS BEEN QUITE A

00:00:09.109 --> 00:00:12.912 line:78%
DAY.

00:00:09.376 --> 00:00:14.014 line:78%
WHAT IS THE LATEST?

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:16.950 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Reporter: WE HAVE HEARD AIR

00:00:14.114 --> 00:00:18.084 line:78%
RAID SIRENS AGAIN THE UKRAINIAN

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:18.551 line:78%
CAPITAL OF KYIV, AND EXPLOSIONS

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:21.821 line:78%
IN THE DISTANCE.

00:00:18.651 --> 00:00:22.522 line:78%
IT'S NOT JUST THIS CITY.

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:24.157 line:78%
THE SECOND LARGEST CITY IN

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:28.661 line:78%
UKRAINE IS ALSO UNDER ATTACK

00:00:24.257 --> 00:00:30.797 line:78%
HEAVY RUSSIAN BOMBARDMENT.

00:00:28.762 --> 00:00:33.199 line:78%
A SQUARE IN THE CENTRAL PART OF

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:36.302 line:78%
THE CITY WAS HIT, KILLING AT

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:38.505 line:78%
LEAST SIX PEOPLE.

00:00:36.403 --> 00:00:39.639 line:78%
THE EVENT WAS CALLED "A WORK

00:00:38.605 --> 00:00:41.207 line:78%
RENT" AND IS CALLING THE

00:00:39.739 --> 00:00:42.976 line:78%
INTERNATIONAL COMMUNITY TO HOLD

00:00:41.307 --> 00:00:46.579 line:78%
THE RUSSIANS ACCOUNTABLE AND

00:00:43.076 --> 00:00:50.683 line:78%
RECONSIDER A NATO ALLIANCE

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:52.252 line:78%
UKRAINE.

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:55.555 line:78%
&gt;&gt; AS FAR AS A NO-FLY ZONE, IT

00:00:52.352 --> 00:00:58.224 line:78%
HAPPENS A LOT.

00:00:55.655 --> 00:00:58.758 line:78%
THIS IS NOT ABOUT DRAGGING NATO

00:00:58.324 --> 00:01:00.393 line:78%
COUNTRIES INTO WAR.

00:00:58.858 --> 00:01:02.495 line:78%
THE TRUTH IS, PEOPLE HAVE BEEN

00:01:00.994 --> 00:01:04.931 line:78%
DRAGGED INTO WAR NOT BY UKRAINE,

00:01:02.595 --> 00:01:06.199 line:78%
BUT BY RUSSIA.

00:01:05.031 --> 00:01:09.102 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Reporter: THOUGH HE IS

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:10.937 line:78%
BEING FROM THE BUNKER IN THE

00:01:09.202 --> 00:01:16.676 line:78%
UKRAINIAN CAPITAL OF KYIV,

00:01:11.037 --> 00:01:18.411 line:78%
LIKELY CIVILIANS, HE IS STAYING

00:01:16.776 --> 00:01:21.347 line:78%
UNDERGROUND OR UNDERCOVER TO

00:01:19.512 --> 00:01:21.681 line:78%
AVOID THE AIR STRIKES ON

00:01:21.448 --> 00:01:25.218 line:78%
UKRAINE.

00:01:21.781 --> 00:01:26.019 line:78%
ALSO, HEARTBREAKING SCENES.

00:01:25.318 --> 00:01:29.923 line:78%
&gt;&gt; A FAMILIAR SCENE UNFOLDS IN

00:01:26.152 --> 00:01:30.890 line:78%
THE UKRAINIAN CAPITAL.

00:01:30.023 --> 00:01:31.391 line:78%
THIS PERSON SAYS GOODBYE TO

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:32.926 line:78%
THEIR DAUGHTER AND

00:01:32.325 --> 00:01:35.395 line:78%
GRANDDAUGHTER, EVACUATING CITY

00:01:33.026 --> 00:01:39.966 line:78%
NEAR THE POLISH BORDER.

00:01:35.495 --> 00:01:40.467 line:78%
&gt;&gt; WE NEED TO LEAVE TO MAKE OUR

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:41.267 line:78%
CHILDREN SAFE.

00:01:40.567 --> 00:01:41.568 line:78%
I NEVER THOUGHT IT WOULD BE LIKE

00:01:41.367 --> 00:01:44.404 line:78%
THAT.

00:01:41.668 --> 00:01:46.606 line:78%
IT'S NOT A JOKE.

00:01:44.504 --> 00:01:47.941 line:78%
&gt;&gt; LIKE THOUSANDS OF UKRAINIAN

00:01:46.806 --> 00:01:50.743 line:78%
MEN, HE WILL STAY AND FIGHT AS

00:01:48.041 --> 00:01:52.412 line:78%
THE RUSSIAN INVASION CONTINUES.

00:01:50.844 --> 00:01:53.580 line:78%
&gt;&gt; MY FAMILY, DAUGHTER,

00:01:52.512 --> 00:01:57.517 line:78%
GRANDDAUGHTER ARE LEAVING.

00:01:55.548 --> 00:01:58.718 line:78%
I AM STAYING TO DEFEND.

00:01:57.617 --> 00:01:59.052 line:78%
&gt;&gt; PEOPLE ARE RUNNING OUT OF

00:01:58.852 --> 00:02:00.353 line:78%
TIME.

00:01:59.152 --> 00:02:00.987 line:78%
THERE'S A REAL UNDERSTANDING

00:02:00.453 --> 00:02:03.022 line:78%
THAT RUSSIAN FORCES COULD

00:02:01.087 --> 00:02:03.323 line:78%
SURROUND THE CITY IN A MATTER OF

00:02:03.123 --> 00:02:04.924 line:78%
DAYS.

00:02:03.423 --> 00:02:06.860 line:78%
A TRAIN STATION IN KYIV, THE

00:02:05.024 --> 00:02:09.863 line:78%
MAJOR EVACUATION POINT PEOPLE

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:12.966 line:78%
LOOKING TO GO WEST --

00:02:09.963 --> 00:02:14.134 line:78%
THE CITY REMAINS ON EDGE

00:02:13.133 --> 00:02:16.402 line:78%
TONIGHT, WITH A CURFEW IN PLACE

00:02:14.234 --> 00:02:21.674 line:78%
AND ROADBLOCKS SET UP THROUGHOUT

00:02:16.503 --> 00:02:22.609 line:78%
THE UKRAINIAN CAPITAL.

00:02:21.774 --> 00:02:25.378 line:78%
&gt;&gt; I HAVE A QUESTION ABOUT

00:02:22.709 --> 00:02:28.414 line:78%
ANOTHER CITY, WHERE THERE WAS A

00:02:25.478 --> 00:02:29.415 line:78%
LOT OF BRAVERY EARLIER IN THE

00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:30.717 line:78%
WEEK.

00:02:30.049 --> 00:02:32.986 line:78%
ONE OF THE SOLDIERS BLEW HIMSELF

00:02:30.817 --> 00:02:33.553 line:78%
UP TO STOP A RUSSIAN ADVANCED,

00:02:33.153 --> 00:02:36.055 line:78%
THAT RIDGE THERE.

00:02:33.653 --> 00:02:43.029 line:78%
THE RUSSIANS ARE THERE NOW

00:02:39.792 --> 00:02:44.664 line:78%
?&gt;&gt; YES, SO THE PART OF UKRAINE

00:02:43.463 --> 00:02:45.965 line:78%
NEAR CRIMEA.

00:02:44.764 --> 00:02:46.799 line:78%
IT'S SIGNIFICANT, ALLOWS THE

00:02:46.166 --> 00:02:49.602 line:78%
RUSSIANS TO CONTINUE THAT LAND

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:51.304 line:78%
BRIDGE INTO UKRAINIAN TERRITORY.

00:02:49.802 --> 00:02:52.038 line:78%
WE WERE IN THIS AREA WITH THE

00:02:51.404 --> 00:02:54.007 line:78%
UKRAINIAN DEFENSE FORCES IN THE

00:02:52.138 --> 00:02:55.508 line:78%
SOUTHERN PART OF THE COUNTRY

00:02:54.107 --> 00:02:58.578 line:78%
ABOUT COKE, AND IT'S NOT VERY

00:02:55.608 --> 00:02:59.345 line:78%
WELL DEFENDED.

00:02:58.678 --> 00:03:00.346 line:78%
RUSSIAN TANKS AND ARTILLERY

00:02:59.445 --> 00:03:02.348 line:78%
UNITS HAVE MOVED QUICKLY INTO

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:03.983 line:78%
THIS PART OF THE COUNTRY, BUT

00:03:02.649 --> 00:03:04.751 line:78%
WHAT IS SIGNIFICANT IS THAT IF

00:03:04.083 --> 00:03:05.885 line:78%
THE RUSSIANS CONTINUE THIS

00:03:04.851 --> 00:03:11.991 line:78%
ADVANCE IN THIS PART OF UKRAINE,

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:12.692 line:78%
IT WOULD ALLOW THEM TO ATTACK

00:03:12.091 --> 00:03:14.861 line:78%
KYIV FROM MULTIPLE DIRECTIONS,

00:03:12.792 --> 00:03:19.165 line:78%
WHICH WOULD BE DIFFICULT TO

00:03:14.961 --> 00:03:20.867 line:78%
DEFEND.

00:03:19.699 --> 00:03:23.069 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Jesse: IF RUSSIAN FORCES

00:03:20.967 --> 00:03:23.803 line:78%
SURROUND THE CITY, WHAT KIND OF

00:03:23.169 --> 00:03:26.539 line:78%
PREPARATIONS ARE UNDERWAY INSIDE

00:03:25.004 --> 00:03:29.142 line:78%
KYIV TO PREPARE THE STOCKPILING

00:03:26.639 --> 00:03:30.276 line:78%
FOOD, WATER AND WEAPONS?

00:03:29.242 --> 00:03:34.147 line:78%
AFTER YOU ARE SURROUNDED,

00:03:30.376 --> 00:03:36.382 line:78%
NOTHING GETTING IN OR OUT.

00:03:34.247 --> 00:03:36.950 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Reporter: WE'VE SEEN IN

00:03:36.583 --> 00:03:39.519 line:78%
RECENT DAYS.

00:03:37.116 --> 00:03:40.954 line:78%
LINES ARE BLOCKED AT GROCERY

00:03:39.619 --> 00:03:42.188 line:78%
STORES, AND ALSO, AROUND THE

00:03:41.054 --> 00:03:42.956 line:78%
BLOCK AT POLICE STATIONS.

00:03:42.288 --> 00:03:46.826 line:78%
CIVILIANS PICKING UP ANY WEAPONS

00:03:43.056 --> 00:03:47.560 line:78%
THEY CAN FIND, GETTING READY FOR

00:03:46.926 --> 00:03:49.229 line:78%
THE RUSSIAN TANKS AND ARTILLERY

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:50.230 line:78%
UNITS TO START ROLLING INTO THIS

00:03:49.329 --> 00:03:51.097 line:78%
CITY.

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:54.400 line:78%
WHAT WE SEEN TODAY IS THAT

00:03:51.197 --> 00:03:56.035 line:78%
PEOPLE ARE USING ANYTHING THEY

00:03:55.268 --> 00:03:56.769 line:78%
CAN TO BLOCK THE ROADS.

00:03:56.135 --> 00:03:59.472 line:78%
THEIR CHECKPOINTS EVERY SINGLE

00:03:56.869 --> 00:04:01.074 line:78%
BLOCK, AND IF WE DON'T HAVE

00:04:00.206 --> 00:04:02.075 line:78%
CONCRETE BARRIERS, THEY ARE

00:04:01.174 --> 00:04:05.111 line:78%
PUSHING OBJECTS INTO THE STREET.

00:04:02.175 --> 00:04:06.012 line:78%
AT ONE POINT, WE SAW A PIANO

00:04:05.211 --> 00:04:08.014 line:78%
THAT HAD BEEN DRAGGED ACROSS THE

00:04:06.112 --> 00:04:10.350 line:78%
ROAD AND PUT INTO THE STREET.

00:04:08.147 --> 00:04:11.184 line:78%
HE GIVES YOU A SENSE OF THE

00:04:10.516 --> 00:04:12.652 line:78%
UKRAINIANS AND THE RESILIENCE OF

00:04:11.284 --> 00:04:16.956 line:78%
WHAT THEY ARE USING: EVERYTHING

00:04:12.752 --> 00:04:18.491 line:78%
THEY CAN TO STOP THE RUSSIAN

00:04:17.056 --> 00:04:20.293 line:78%
ADVANCE AREA &gt;&gt; Jeanine: WE

00:04:18.591 --> 00:04:21.027 line:78%
HAVE BEEN TALKING ABOUT THIS

00:04:20.393 --> 00:04:26.633 line:78%
40 MILES RUSSIAN CONVOY ENTERING

00:04:21.127 --> 00:04:30.503 line:78%
THE UKRAINE.

00:04:26.733 --> 00:04:38.745 line:78%
WHY IS IT NO ONE HAS ATTACKED

00:04:33.673 --> 00:04:41.080 line:78%
THAT CONVOY WITH A MISSILE?

00:04:39.212 --> 00:04:41.447 line:78%
&gt;&gt; THE UKRAINIANS DON'T HAVE THE

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:43.783 line:78%
FIREPOWER.

00:04:41.547 --> 00:04:44.450 line:78%
THE INTERNATIONAL COMMUNITY DOES

00:04:43.883 --> 00:04:47.920 line:78%
NOT WANT TO GET INVOLVED AND

00:04:45.018 --> 00:04:49.155 line:78%
RISK THE RUSSIANS

00:04:48.021 --> 00:04:51.024 line:78%
COUNTERATTACKING, WHICH WOULD

00:04:49.255 --> 00:04:51.991 line:78%
TRIGGER ARTICLE FIVE OF NATO.

00:04:51.124 --> 00:04:55.161 line:78%
WHAT IS SIGNIFICANT ABOUT THIS

00:04:52.091 --> 00:04:57.130 line:78%
CONVOY: IT'S COMING IN THROUGH

00:04:55.261 --> 00:05:00.433 line:78%
THIS AIR BASE THAT JUST OUTSIDE

00:04:57.897 --> 00:05:02.535 line:78%
OF THE CITY LIMITS OF KYIV.

00:05:00.533 --> 00:05:04.003 line:78%
IT'S CENTRAL TO FIGHTING WITH

00:05:02.835 --> 00:05:04.737 line:78%
THIS VISION FIRST STARTED, BUT

00:05:04.137 --> 00:05:07.240 line:78%
NOW THAT THE RUSSIANS CONTROL

00:05:05.004 --> 00:05:08.374 line:78%
THIS AREA, THEY ARE LIKELY TO

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:10.076 line:78%
START A GROUND INVASION AND

00:05:08.474 --> 00:05:11.311 line:78%
OFFENSE OF INTO THE CITY FROM

00:05:10.176 --> 00:05:12.145 line:78%
THE NORTHWEST.

00:05:11.411 --> 00:05:14.280 line:78%
WHEN THAT HAPPENS, UKRAINIANS

00:05:12.245 --> 00:05:16.149 line:78%
ARE GOING TO BE HIT HARD.

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:17.617 line:78%
IT'S PART OF THE REASON THEY ARE

00:05:16.449 --> 00:05:18.785 line:78%
HOPING THAT RUSSIAN FORCES DON'T

00:05:17.717 --> 00:05:20.920 line:78%
MAKE A QUICKER ADVANCE ON THE

00:05:18.885 --> 00:05:22.722 line:78%
CITY FROM OTHER DIRECTIONS.

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:24.123 line:78%
THEY HAVE TO SPREAD OUT THEIR

00:05:22.822 --> 00:05:24.891 line:78%
FORCES, AND IT WOULD

00:05:24.223 --> 00:05:27.960 line:78%
SIGNIFICANTLY WEAKEN THE DEFENSE

00:05:24.991 --> 00:05:30.363 line:78%
FORCES HERE IN UKRAINE.

00:05:28.061 --> 00:05:31.164 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Jeanine: I UNDERSTAND THAT

00:05:30.463 --> 00:05:36.302 line:78%
WE DON'T WANT TO DO IT FROM THE

00:05:31.264 --> 00:05:37.303 line:78%
AIR TO THE GROUND, BUT ARE YOU

00:05:36.602 --> 00:05:40.840 line:78%
SAYING THERE ARE NO HELLFIRE

00:05:37.403 --> 00:05:42.175 line:78%
MISSILES, NO DRONES, THAT HAVE

00:05:40.973 --> 00:05:43.109 line:78%
TO COME FROM THE AIR?

00:05:42.408 --> 00:05:43.743 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Reporter: THEY HAVE DRONES

00:05:43.209 --> 00:05:45.945 line:78%
AND MISSILES.

00:05:43.843 --> 00:05:47.547 line:78%
THEY'VE TAKEN OUT A NUMBER OF

00:05:46.045 --> 00:05:48.281 line:78%
RUSSIAN UNITS ALONG DIFFERENT

00:05:47.714 --> 00:05:51.517 line:78%
CONVOYS, AND HAVE BEEN QUITE

00:05:48.381 --> 00:05:53.386 line:78%
SUCCESSFUL WITH THE ANTITANK.

00:05:51.617 --> 00:05:54.987 line:78%
IT'S ONE OF THE REASON THAT ONE

00:05:53.486 --> 00:05:56.823 line:78%
OF THE MAIN REQUESTS FROM THE

00:05:55.088 --> 00:05:57.490 line:78%
DEFENSE MINISTER IN THE UKRAINE

00:05:56.923 --> 00:06:01.027 line:78%
IS MORE ANTITANK MISSILES.

00:05:57.590 --> 00:06:02.595 line:78%
ANOTHER POINT HAS TO DO WITH THE

00:06:01.127 --> 00:06:04.697 line:78%
SKIES.

00:06:03.563 --> 00:06:05.998 line:78%
EVERYONE THOUGHT THAT THE

00:06:04.797 --> 00:06:06.766 line:78%
RUSSIANS WOULD CONTROL THE

00:06:06.099 --> 00:06:11.604 line:78%
SKIES, AS THEIR AIR FORCE IS TEN

00:06:07.734 --> 00:06:13.873 line:78%
TIMES THE SIZE OF UKRAINIANS.

00:06:12.972 --> 00:06:16.109 line:78%
SO FAR, UKRAINIAN SUB-SHUTDOWN

00:06:13.973 --> 00:06:16.542 line:78%
FIGHTER JETS AND HELICOPTERS IN

00:06:16.209 --> 00:06:17.944 line:78%
THIS BATTLE.

00:06:16.642 --> 00:06:18.678 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Dana: I WANT TO POINT OUT

00:06:18.044 --> 00:06:22.448 line:78%
THAT THERE IS A NEW VIDEO THAT

00:06:18.778 --> 00:06:26.586 line:78%
WE ARE SHOWING ON THE SCREEN.

00:06:22.548 --> 00:06:27.186 line:78%
IT'S A VERY DIFFERENT DAY TODAY

00:06:26.686 --> 00:06:29.355 line:78%
THAN YESTERDAY WITH THE

00:06:27.286 --> 00:06:30.089 line:78%
ADDITIONAL DAMAGE YOU ARE

00:06:29.455 --> 00:06:31.758 line:78%
SEEING, UNLIKE WHAT WE'VE SEEN

00:06:30.189 --> 00:06:37.697 line:78%
IN EUROPE SINCE WORLD WAR II.

00:06:32.959 --> 00:06:39.332 line:78%
DO YOU HAVE A QUESTION FOR --

00:06:37.797 --> 00:06:40.633 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Harold: FIRST OF ALL,

00:06:39.432 --> 00:06:41.200 line:78%
THANK YOU FOR YOUR BRAVE

00:06:40.733 --> 00:06:46.606 line:78%
REPORTING AND BRAVERY.

00:06:41.300 --> 00:06:49.642 line:78%
WE HEARD THAT -- ANY SENSE OF IF

00:06:46.706 --> 00:06:52.712 line:78%
THERE IS AN ALTERING AND ASK OF

00:06:49.742 --> 00:06:54.147 line:78%
UKRAINE OR THE UKRAINIANS, LED

00:06:52.812 --> 00:06:56.783 line:78%
BY THIS GREAT PRESIDENT OF

00:06:54.247 --> 00:06:57.417 line:78%
THEIRS, GOING TO ACCEPT

00:06:56.883 --> 00:06:59.385 line:78%
SOMETHING IN LIGHT OF THE

00:06:57.517 --> 00:07:02.355 line:78%
PRESSURE THAT KYIV SEEMS TO BE

00:06:59.485 --> 00:07:03.623 line:78%
UNDER THIS EVENING?

00:07:02.455 --> 00:07:05.258 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Reporter: THERE WILL LIKELY

00:07:03.723 --> 00:07:06.592 line:78%
BE ANOTHER MEETING BETWEEN THE

00:07:05.358 --> 00:07:07.193 line:78%
RUSSIANS AND UKRAINIANS IN THE

00:07:06.692 --> 00:07:09.695 line:78%
COMING DAYS, BUT WHAT IS

00:07:07.293 --> 00:07:11.330 line:78%
IMPORTANT TO REMEMBER IS THAT

00:07:09.796 --> 00:07:15.334 line:78%
THE RUSSIANS OFTEN PROMISE

00:07:11.431 --> 00:07:16.502 line:78%
THINGS ON THE GROUND, AND THEN

00:07:15.435 --> 00:07:17.270 line:78%
ACT VERY DIFFERENTLY WITH THEIR

00:07:17.003 --> 00:07:18.704 line:78%
MILITARY.

00:07:17.537 --> 00:07:19.972 line:78%
WE SAW A STARK CONTRAST WHEN

00:07:18.805 --> 00:07:20.406 line:78%
THEY MET ON THE BORDER OF

00:07:20.072 --> 00:07:21.474 line:78%
BELARUS.

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:24.110 line:78%
THE RUSSIANS SHOWED UP IN SUITS

00:07:22.842 --> 00:07:24.544 line:78%
AND TIES, AND UKRAINIANS, BATTLE

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:26.179 line:78%
FATIGUES.

00:07:24.811 --> 00:07:28.381 line:78%
WE ALSO GOT MORE INFORMATION

00:07:26.279 --> 00:07:30.316 line:78%
FROM THE FRENCH, BECAUSE THEY

00:07:28.481 --> 00:07:32.218 line:78%
SPOKE WITH PRESIDENT PUTIN OF

00:07:30.416 --> 00:07:32.752 line:78%
RUSSIA, THE FRENCH PRESIDENT

00:07:32.318 --> 00:07:34.821 line:78%
EMMANUEL MACRON.

00:07:33.152 --> 00:07:36.923 line:78%
IT GAVE US A SENSE OF HOW

00:07:34.921 --> 00:07:37.557 line:78%
UNREALISTIC THE RUSSIAN DEMANDS

00:07:37.023 --> 00:07:39.192 line:78%
ARE.

00:07:38.191 --> 00:07:41.360 line:78%
THEY WOULD LIKE UKRAINE TO GIVE

00:07:39.292 --> 00:07:44.263 line:78%
UP THEIR WEAPONS, AND RECOGNIZED

00:07:43.062 --> 00:07:49.168 line:78%
AN AREA OF LAND ANNEXED BY

00:07:44.363 --> 00:07:49.869 line:78%
RUSSIA -- THESE ARE 

00:07:49.268 --> 00:07:50.870 line:78%
NONSTARTER'S, AND THAT'S TRUE

00:07:49.969 --> 00:07:51.404 line:78%
FOR ANY PEACE PROCESS THAT WOULD

00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:55.241 line:78%
COME OUT OF THIS.

00:07:51.537 --> 00:07:55.241 line:78%
&gt;&gt; A COUPLE OF US.

00:08:00.947 --> 00:08:02.148 line:78%
&gt;&gt; &gt;&gt; Harold:

00:08:05.485 --> 00:08:08.855 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Harold: KHARKIV WASSURROUNDE.

00:08:07.687 --> 00:08:11.524 line:78%
IT IS BEEN SAID THAT THEY ARE

00:08:08.955 --> 00:08:13.159 line:78%
GOING WORK FOR CIVILIANS, GONE

00:08:12.058 --> 00:08:13.993 line:78%
FROM GOING OUT FIGHTERS TO

00:08:13.359 --> 00:08:16.329 line:78%
CIVILIAN TARGETS.

00:08:14.093 --> 00:08:19.932 line:78%
HOW DOES THAT MAKE YOU FEEL,

00:08:16.996 --> 00:08:22.201 line:78%
KNOWING THAT THERE IS A 40-MILE

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:26.339 line:78%
CARAVAN ABOUT 10 MILES AWAY FROM

00:08:22.301 --> 00:08:26.973 line:78%
YOU WITH THE SAME INTENTION?

00:08:26.439 --> 00:08:29.909 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Reporter: THE RUSSIANS

00:08:28.608 --> 00:08:32.044 line:78%
